The tour (Resources/Tour) contains:

- Official specimen images, not real people's documents, each with the masks MaskCopy's engine made
  for it (`maske tour`):
  - United States passport data page, U.S. Department of State, public domain
    (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2007-2021_United_States_passport_data_page_and_signature_page.jpg)
  - People's Republic of China resident identity card sample, front, CC0
    (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_People%27s_Republic_of_China_resident_identity_card_(SAMPLE)_front.png)
  - Dutch passport specimen data page (RvIG, 2014), CC0
    (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dutch_passport_specimen_issued_9_March_2014.jpg)
- A dotted globe generated by scripts/globe.py from Natural Earth 1:110m countries, public domain
  (https://www.naturalearthdata.com).
